15px;line-height:24px;color:#18181b;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p><a href="https://example.com/projects/launch/tasks/review" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank">https://example.com/projects/launch/tasks/review</a><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e7e5e4;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:28px 0 20px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#71717a;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">If you did not request this email, you can safely ignore it.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "TanBase Core


TASK REMINDER

Hi Amina,

“Review the release” in Launch needs your attention. It is due tomorrow at 09:00.

View task https://example.com/projects/launch/tasks/review

If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:

https://example.com/projects/launch/tasks/review

----------------------------------------

If you did not request this email, you can safely ignore it.",
}
`;

